# Multi-Attribute Data Visualization Analysis Model for Multimedia

**Authors:** Jun Wu, Yaoxin Chen

## Abstract
With the rapid development of Multimedia technology and big data, all areas of application data exploded causing difficult to analyze and mine useful information from big data. Along with the development of Python applications, data analysis with characteristics of multimedia area needs more targeted and efficient new methods. In this paper, aiming at the shortage of existing work, we propose a Multimedia big data analysis platform based on Data crawl and Data visualization by Python.

